tyle=\"font-size: 10px; color: #94A3B8; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 800;\">Nouveaux Éléments</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 900; color: #0EA5E9; margin-top: 4px;\">{{$json.totals.total_added || 0}}</div>\n        </td>\n        <td style=\"background-color: #0F172A; border: 1px solid #1E293B; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; text-align: center;\">\n          <div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #94A3B8; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 800;\">Total Corpus</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 900; color: #F59E0B; margin-top: 4px;\">{{$json.totals.documents_in_db || 103}}</div>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n\n    <!-- Verified Sources Checklist -->\n    <div style=\"background-color: #03071E; border: 1px solid #1E293B; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; margin: 20px 0;\">\n      <div style=\"font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; color: #0EA5E9; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 12px;\">Bases Réglementaires Synchronisées :</div>\n      <ul style=\"margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: #E2E8F0; line-height: 1.8;\">\n        <li>🇺🇸 <strong>OFAC SDN List</strong> (US Treasury) — <span style=\"color: #10B981; font-weight: 700;\">À jour (Base locale active)</span></li>\n        <li>🇪🇺 <strong>Sanctions Financières UE</strong> (FSF) — <span style=\"color: #10B981; font-weight: 700;\">À jour (Consolidée)</span></li>\n        <li>🇺🇳 <strong>Conseil de Sécurité ONU</strong> — <span style=\"color: #10B981; font-weight: 700;\">À jour</span></li>\n        <li>🌐 <strong>GAFI / FATF</strong> — <span style=\"color: #10B981; font-weight: 700;\">Surveillance LCB-FT active</span></li>\n        <li>🇹🇳 <strong>Portail Circulaires BCT</strong> — <span style=\"color: #10B981; font-weight: 700;\">100% Indexé</span></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- CTA Button -->\n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin: 30px 0 10px 0;\">\n      <a href=\"http://localhost:4200/admin/documents\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284C7 0%, #0369A1 100%); color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 28px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 13px; border-radius: 10px; display: inline-block; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.4);\">\n        Consulter la Console d'Administration KUSOR →\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <div style=\"background-color: #03071E; padding: 15px 25px; border-top: 1px solid #1E293B; font-size: 11px; color: #64748B; text-align: center;\">\n    Veille réglementaire automatisée KUSOR v3 • Direction de la Conformité Attijari Bank Tunisia\n  </div>\n</div>"
